    "ytm_description": "Bad Bunny is a multi-platinum global artist and 7x GRAMMY®️ winner whose influence extends far beyond music. A singular cultural force, he has redefined the possibilities of Spanish-language artistry on the world stage, breaking barriers while remaining unapologetically rooted in Puerto Rico.\n\n\"DeBÍ TiRAR MáS FOToS\" became the first fully Spanish-language album to win the GRAMMY®️ Award for Album of the Year, a landmark achievement that reshaped the global conversation around Latin music. He headlined the Apple Music Super Bowl LX Halftime Show, transforming one of the world’s largest broadcast stages into a defining moment for Spanish-language artistry on a global platform and driving a worldwide surge across the Apple Music charts.\n\nHe previously made history as the first artist to receive an Album of the Year nomination for a Spanish-language album with \"Un Verano Sin Ti\" and as the first Latin act to headline Coachella. His record-breaking tours and sold-out residencies have set new industry standards.\n\nBad Bunny continues to push boundaries, proving that language, genre and geography are no limitations."
  },
